1
00:00:00,532 --> 00:00:02,122
Do you guys know how to fish?

2
00:00:02,634 --> 00:00:04,624
(Howard:)- No.
- No.

3
00:00:05,370 --> 00:00:09,310
(Raj:)But if you catch anything,
I know how to steam it in banana leaves.

4
00:00:10,308 --> 00:00:14,298
(Howard:)Come on, we must know somebody
who can do manly stuff like this.

5
00:00:17,649 --> 00:00:19,479
What's up?

6
00:00:25,357 --> 00:00:27,757
(Penny:)Step one, worms.

7
00:00:29,194 --> 00:00:30,214
(Howard:)Ew.

8
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:36,760
Okay, "ew" is one of the things you're not
gonna wanna say in front of your father-in-law.

9
00:00:37,002 --> 00:00:39,972
(Penny:)It's right up there with
"icky" and "get it away."

10
00:00:40,572 --> 00:00:43,332
(Penny:)- Now pick one up.
- Really?

11
00:00:43,541 --> 00:00:47,271
- You're gonna have to do it when you're fishing.
- Okay.

12
00:00:51,016 --> 00:00:52,176
(Penny:)What are you waiting for?

13
00:00:52,384 --> 00:00:55,414
(Howard:)I don't know.
For them to die of natural causes?

14
00:00:56,554 --> 00:01:01,024
(Penny:)Just pick up a worm
and put him on this hook.

